		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Welcome to the Next.js documentation!"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 2,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "What is Next.js?"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Next.js is a React framework for building full-stack web applications. You use React Components to build user interfaces, and Next.js for additional features and optimizations."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "It also automatically configures lower-level tools like bundlers and compilers. You can instead focus on building your product and shipping quickly."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Whether you're an individual developer or part of a larger team, Next.js can help you build interactive, dynamic, and fast React applications."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "heading",
			"depth": 2,
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "How to use the docs"
				}
			]
		},
